                                "sense_id": "2d84246f-db5e-36ec-aa58-f8e5342b4993",
                                "text": "If the president invokes the Insurrection Act [of 1807], it temporarily suspends Posse Comitatus and allows him to federalize the National Guard and deploy active duty troops to suppress any uprising that interferes with the execution of state or federal law."
                            },
                            {
