                                "sense_id": "2d84246f-db5e-36ec-aa58-f8e5342b4993",
                                "text": "“President Trump’s deployment of federalized National Guard troops in response to protests is unnecessary, inflammatory, and an abuse of power,” said Hina Shamsi, director of the ACLU’s National Security Project."
                            }
